                <pb facs="0567" n="495" sameAs="frus:frus1909/pg495"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 5931/462.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé de Billier to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-07-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">July 22,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Says the British minister on behalf of British Government has recognized the new
                    Shah of Persia on July 21 and asks if he may recognize Government.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
